\* All TLC check configs for AntflyBatcherCoalescing.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive tier=fast
SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyDeleteWriteInversion = FALSE
    BuggyWriteDeleteInversion = FALSE
    BuggyPartialVisibility = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    LastOperationWinsPerKey
    DeleteVisibleBeforeWriteOnly
    NoPartialVisibility
    Safety

==== BadDeleteVisibleWithoutDelete
\* Expected-failure config for AntflyBatcherCoalescing.tla.
\* Reuses the delete->write inversion mutant, pinned to the invariant that a
\* durable deleted value must come from a trailing delete operation.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyDeleteWriteInversion = TRUE
    BuggyWriteDeleteInversion = FALSE
    BuggyPartialVisibility = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    DeleteVisibleBeforeWriteOnly

==== BadDeleteWriteInversion
\* Expected-failure config for AntflyBatcherCoalescing.tla.
\* Enables a mutant where delete+write for the same key flushes as delete.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyDeleteWriteInversion = TRUE
    BuggyWriteDeleteInversion = FALSE
    BuggyPartialVisibility = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    LastOperationWinsPerKey

==== BadPartialVisibility
\* Expected-failure config for AntflyBatcherCoalescing.tla.
\* Enables a mutant where a partially coalesced batch becomes visible.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyDeleteWriteInversion = FALSE
    BuggyWriteDeleteInversion = FALSE
    BuggyPartialVisibility = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    NoPartialVisibility

==== BadWriteDeleteInversion
\* Expected-failure config for AntflyBatcherCoalescing.tla.
\* Enables a mutant where write+delete for the same key flushes as written.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyDeleteWriteInversion = FALSE
    BuggyWriteDeleteInversion = TRUE
    BuggyPartialVisibility = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    LastOperationWinsPerKey
